KG42.register("clusters-11c4b59e8b3bf58a8852410d",{"id":"35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v142-d-K002","paper":"35-microgrid_pool_strategy","label":"Microgrid bidirectional modified bidding under DLMP feedback","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K002","label":"Microgrid bidirectional modified bidding under DLMP feedback","market_meaning":"An independently operated price-making microgrid receives the nodal DLMP generated by the DEM, forms a benchmark bid, and, based on the PCC exchange direction and the comparison of its own marginal cost with the DLMP, chooses a modified demand bid price or supply offer. The DS spot-load forecast price and the customer linearization curve assumption in R002 retain their respective entity scopes.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["DEM"],"process_stages":["bidding","coordination","pricing"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"The input power applies to the same microgrid, connection node, and time period; the import-demand branch and the export-supply branch are retained as mutually exclusive. The benchmark price in R007 and the modified bids in R002 and R003 serve different roles. R010 only shares the DLMP generation interface, and its KKT non-negativity restriction retains its original conditions. The DS spot load is not rewritten as using the microgrid bid-modification strategy.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"The price signal, the microgrid's autonomous decision, and the bidirectional conditional bids jointly express one bid-formation rule. The clearing model is shared and cited as the price source; the frozen chain does not yet cover the complete branches or the procedure by which modified bids enter subsequent clearing.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R002","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"This provides the import-demand bidding conditions, price feedback, and two frozen demand-bid adjustment branches, while retaining the spot-load and customer-curve assumptions."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"This provides the export-supply offer conditions and two frozen supply-offer adjustment branches."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"primary","role":"interface","rationale":"This passes the DEM nodal DLMP to the microgrid and forms the benchmark bid, supplementing the autonomous-decision conditions of the price-making microgrid."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R010","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Only its endogenous DLMP source and existing applicability conditions are cited; the primary attribution lies in the clearing-pricing cluster, and no independent pricing rule is added here."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-CN01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-X001","v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R007::theta::theta-R007-dlmp","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-E15","v141-b-g02-E28"],"rationale":"The source states that the DLMP generated endogenously within the LLPM is used by the microgrid as the benchmark bid; the endogenous price in clearing becomes a given signal input on the microgrid side, and the local variable roles remain separate."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-CN02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::theta::theta-R007-dlmp","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-theta-lambda","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C005","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C006"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g02-E28","v141-b-g02-E32","v141-b-g02-E33"],"rationale":"The DLMP feedback provides the price input used by the demand-bid branch, and branch selection remains limited by the import-power state and the cost comparison."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-CN03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::theta::theta-R007-dlmp","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R003::theta::v141-c-R003-theta-lambda-P-bt","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C003","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g02-E28","v141-b-g02-E30","v141-b-g02-E31"],"rationale":"The DLMP feedback for the same mechanism provides the price input for the export-supply offer, retaining the export state and the cost-comparison conditions."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K002-CN04","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-x-Pjt","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C005","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C006"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R003::x::v141-c-R003-x-P-jt","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C003","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E26","v141-b-g02-E28","v141-b-g02-E30","v141-b-g02-E31","v141-b-g02-E32","v141-b-g02-E33"],"rationale":"The source treats import bidding and export offering as directional branches of the same microgrid modification strategy; the two chains are complementary, do not mean simultaneous import and export in the same time period, and do not establish a sequential execution dependency."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-OM01","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R002::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R010::V::pricing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R010::V::pricing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-E28"],"rationale":"The three places are the same frozen local pricing node, and the sources all refer to the DLMP of the DEM in this mechanism; the display uses the price-generation chain as the entry point and retains the functional bindings at each place."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-OM02","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::coordination.price_signal","v141-c-R007::V::coordination.price_signal"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R007::V::coordination.price_signal","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E08","v141-b-g02-E28"],"rationale":"Both places reference the same frozen price-coordination node, respectively serving signal transmission and supply-offer application, and R007 is selected as the display entry."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-OM03","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-X001","v141-c-R007::theta::theta-R007-dlmp","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-theta-lambda","v141-c-R003::theta::v141-c-R003-theta-lambda-P-bt"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-E15","v141-b-g02-E28"],"rationale":"Under the applicability conditions of the same node and time period, the four places represent the same active-power DLMP. The endogenous dual variable in R010 and the given signal parameter in other chains retain different local roles, and their category or definition is not rewritten."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-OM04","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-x-Pjt","v141-c-R003::x::v141-c-R003-x-P-jt"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E26","v141-b-g02-E30","v141-b-g02-E31","v141-b-g02-E32","v141-b-g02-E33"],"rationale":"The two places are the MG–DS active-power exchange quantity for the same microgrid and the same time period; the import and export intervals are retained separately, and the association does not mean that the power values of the two branches hold simultaneously."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-OM05","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-x-alpha-prime","v141-c-R003::x::v141-c-R003-x-alpha-prime-jt"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E28","v141-b-g02-E30","v141-b-g02-E31","v141-b-g02-E32","v141-b-g02-E33"],"rationale":"The source explicitly uses the same modified bid quantity to cover both directional branches; the local uses and conditions of the demand price and supply price are retained separately and are not equated with the benchmark price in R007."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-OM06","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-theta-beta","v141-c-R003::theta::v141-c-R003-theta-beta-jt"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g02-E28"],"rationale":"Both places are the marginal operating cost of the same microgrid and time period, and the source uses it as an input to the unified modification strategy; the different uses in the demand and supply comparisons are retained."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K002-OM07","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-theta-epsilon","v141-c-R003::theta::v141-c-R003-theta-epsilon"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E30","v141-b-g02-E33","v141-b-g02-E34"],"rationale":"The price adjustments in both directions cite the small positive constant uniformly described by the source; the original differences in the unit field are retained, and the example value is not converted into a fixed value."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G01","category":"math_incomplete","description":"The frozen bid chain includes only the branches with nonzero exchange and marginal cost strictly higher or lower than the DLMP. The zero-exchange branch in source E29 has not entered C, and there are differences in its price index; the strategy when cost is exactly equal to the DLMP is also not specified.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C005","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C006","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C003","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E29","v141-b-g02-E30","v141-b-g02-E31","v141-b-g02-E32","v141-b-g02-E33"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"C is to supplement the manually checked zero-exchange branch and address the index differences in the original text; the equality case requires source support or an explicit restriction of the candidate's applicable scope, and the existing branches must not be extended on one's own."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G02","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The DLMP same-quantity interface is conditioned on the DS node where the microgrid is located and the same time period, but C has not independently encoded the complete mapping between microgrid indices and connection-node indices. Generic nodal prices cannot be directly merged across microgrids or across nodes.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C003","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-theta-lambda","v141-c-R003::theta::v141-c-R003-theta-lambda-P-bt","v141-c-R010::x::v141-c-R010-X001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-E15","v141-b-g02-E28"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the connection-node notation and index ranges, and C is to fill in the node correspondence; before that, use the same-quantity association conditionally by node and time period."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G03","category":"upstream_missing","description":"The benchmark bid, the modified bid, and the original bid input to the LLPM do not form an explicit write-back interface in the existing chain, and the re-clearing or iteration-termination procedure has also not been frozen; therefore a complete closed loop cannot yet be claimed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R002::x::v141-c-R002-x-alpha-prime","v141-c-R003::x::v141-c-R003-x-alpha-prime-jt","v141-c-R007::x::x-R007-base-bid-price","v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E15","v141-b-g02-E16","v141-b-g02-E26","v141-b-g02-E28"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Verify the source's description of modified bids entering clearing, and C is to clarify the relevant interfaces and procedures; keep the benchmark price and the modified price separate, and do not presume that they are equal."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G04","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The same adjustment constant has an empty unit in R002 and a price unit in R003; the source gives only a very small positive number and an example, and the exact value and unit have not yet been uniformly confirmed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-theta-epsilon","v141-c-R003::theta::v141-c-R003-theta-epsilon"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E30","v141-b-g02-E33","v141-b-g02-E34"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the price unit and numerical scaling, and then C is to decide whether to complete the unit; during the same-quantity association, the original fields are retained, and the example is not treated as a fixed parameter."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G05","category":"ontology_extension","description":"The refined semantics of nodal DLMP and price-making prosumer microgrids still depend on textual qualification; proposals v141-b-g01-P01 and v141-b-g01-P02 remain unapproved.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R007::V::coordination.price_signal","v141-c-R002::V::bidding.demand","v141-c-R003::V::bidding.supply"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E08","v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-E28"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g01-P01","v141-b-g01-P02"],"required_work":"Manually check whether the generic nodes can adequately express nodal prices and price-maker conditions, and then decide whether to extend the ontology; this candidate only references existing nodes."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K002-G06","category":"unverified_source","description":"The B evidence used for price feedback, bid branches, and related object mappings remains unverified, and the current assembly has only experimental candidate status.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R010"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E08","v141-b-g01-E11","v141-b-g02-E15","v141-b-g02-E28","v141-b-g02-E29","v141-b-g02-E30","v141-b-g02-E31","v141-b-g02-E32","v141-b-g02-E33","v141-b-g02-E34"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually verify the original text, conditions, indices, and units; in this round, no B audit, C2 independent review, or Agent E was performed, and it cannot be concluded on this basis that the scientific validity of the bids has passed review."}]},"rule_refs":["35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R002","35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R003","35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R007","35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R010"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-276b46f772c03e0a","COMP-8887f8698ce32d83","COMP-9f466bc0c4377893","COMP-ab3d11c48c98c7be","COMP-aca52f9d7c02a0d7","KG40-e94214b4dec2eb9b"]});
